WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:04.320
What's up guys!

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:05.400
We are Pongfinity

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:08.400
With us today we have football specialist Lassi Hurskainen

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:09.600
Oh nice!

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:12.280
And to celebrate the EURO 2020 we are combining

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:13.500
Ping pong with football!

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:14.560
Let's go, throw it up! 

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:36.400
Let's go through the cones!

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:46.760
I don't have a good feeling about this!

00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:56.900
YES!!!

00:01:09.180 --> 00:01:10.700
Can you do that with a football?

00:01:10.900 --> 00:01:12.580
Yes, give me a bigger ball

00:01:30.860 --> 00:01:32.440
Time to go through the hoop!

00:01:33.040 --> 00:01:33.500
Easy!

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:34.660
You might as well throw it too!

00:01:34.660 --> 00:01:35.600
You sure?
- Yeah, yeah!

00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:36.040
Okay.

00:01:38.120 --> 00:01:38.760
Typical.

00:01:54.980 --> 00:01:56.920
Okay Lassi, crossbar challenge

00:02:01.380 --> 00:02:02.720
Let's go a little bit further away!

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:10.980
Arrggghh! 

00:02:13.180 --> 00:02:14.160
Arrggghh! 

00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:15.980
How dare you!

00:02:16.260 --> 00:02:17.180
Okay Lassi

00:02:17.180 --> 00:02:18.140
Time for some doubles

00:02:18.140 --> 00:02:19.000
Absolutely!

00:02:19.400 --> 00:02:20.820
Here's the racket

00:02:21.600 --> 00:02:23.060
I don't need one, thank you!

00:02:50.700 --> 00:02:51.640
Level 3, Otto!

00:02:51.680 --> 00:02:52.660
Yeah, show me!

00:03:01.540 --> 00:03:03.240
Ok, you can decide your level 3

00:03:03.580 --> 00:03:05.320
Yea? Ok, where's your car?

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:07.960
Why?

00:03:39.420 --> 00:03:40.440
Did it go in?

00:03:40.440 --> 00:03:42.120
Yeah, the first one went in!

00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:44.720
Huge thanks for joining us today Lassi!

00:03:44.720 --> 00:03:45.540
Absolutely!

00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:49.640
I was so impressed we were able to come up with so many tricks combining these two sports!

00:03:49.640 --> 00:03:50.220
What do you think?

00:03:50.220 --> 00:03:52.200
Yeah, let us know what was your favorite!

00:03:52.380 --> 00:03:53.100
Hey, last shot!

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:54.120
Go wide!

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:55.180
Okay, okay!

00:03:55.180 --> 00:03:56.780
Go, go, go!!

00:03:58.320 --> 00:03:59.740
[Evil laughter]

00:03:59.740 --> 00:04:01.600
I was so ready for something!

